flowchart LR
  inbox[Gmail: new customer email] --> trigger[n8n Gmail Trigger]
  trigger --> normalize[Normalize sender, subject, body, message ID, thread ID]
  normalize --> api[POST /webhooks/n8n/inbound]
  api --> dedupe{Seen message ID?}
  dedupe -->|yes| existing[Return existing case]
  dedupe -->|no| classify[Classify intent against store policy]
  policy[(store-policy.json)] --> classify
  classify --> grounded[Create policy-grounded reply draft]
  llm{OpenAI key available?} -. optional wording .-> grounded
  grounded --> review{Sensitive or uncertain?}
  review -->|yes| human[Flag for staff review]
  review -->|no| create[Create Gmail reply draft in original thread]
  human --> create
  create --> done[Staff reviews and sends manually]
  create --> read[Mark source message read after draft succeeds]
